From: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Oct 2018 14:13:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Don't reset compiler's flags during checks

Signed-off-by: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 34fc035..0283f83 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -10,10 +10,7 @@ AC_PREFIX_DEFAULT(/usr/local)
 
 
 # Checks for programs, and clears CFLAGS during the check.
-X="$CFLAGS"
-CFLAGS=""
 AC_PROG_CC
-CFLAGS="$X"
 
 
 # Checks for header files.
